WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.281 --> 00:00:03.114
(whimsical music)

00:00:04.202 --> 00:00:06.088
- Walter, Pepper and Chili.

00:00:06.088 --> 00:00:09.739
Louvinia, Billy Idol, Lil'
Hootie, Stevie Wonder,

00:00:09.739 --> 00:00:12.027
Opus, Lolly, Top Hat.

00:00:12.027 --> 00:00:15.527
Right now I think I have about 36 turtles.

00:00:16.659 --> 00:00:20.826
I'm Lorri Cramer, I'm the
turtle lady of Manhattan.

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:25.213
I'm the only wildlife
rehabilitator in the city

00:00:25.213 --> 00:00:28.522
that works just specifically with turtles.

00:00:28.522 --> 00:00:32.605
I rehab turtles in an
apartment in New York City.

00:00:33.486 --> 00:00:36.198
Bringing turtles into
the country illegally,

00:00:36.198 --> 00:00:38.442
has become big business.

00:00:38.442 --> 00:00:40.379
I get turtles from the Department

00:00:40.379 --> 00:00:44.373
of Environmental Conservation,
U.S. Fish and Wildlife,

00:00:44.373 --> 00:00:47.873
the urban park rangers, even by policemen.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:55.777
Last summer I had 680 baby
turtles that were brought

00:00:56.988 --> 00:01:01.162
here from the Department of
Environmental Conservation.

00:01:01.162 --> 00:01:05.086
It's overwhelming to have
a large amount of turtles

00:01:05.086 --> 00:01:07.996
in a New York City apartment.

00:01:07.996 --> 00:01:10.395
I've promised my husband a bathroom

00:01:10.395 --> 00:01:12.947
and a bedroom without turtles.

00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:15.365
The back bathroom is
where we take our showers,

00:01:15.365 --> 00:01:20.257
and it's a people bathroom. (laughs)

00:01:20.257 --> 00:01:22.983
If I lived outside the
city and I had a yard,

00:01:22.983 --> 00:01:25.209
I probably would be rehabilitating

00:01:25.209 --> 00:01:27.639
all kinds of wild animals.

00:01:27.639 --> 00:01:31.222
But here in Manhattan,
turtles are perfect.

00:01:32.321 --> 00:01:35.519
When I was a child there was no place

00:01:35.519 --> 00:01:37.380
for women in vet school.

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:40.831
But somehow things come full circle.

00:01:40.831 --> 00:01:44.464
I'm a turtle nurse, that's basically it.

00:01:44.464 --> 00:01:48.784
I think that I’ll get good
turtle points in Heaven.

00:01:48.784 --> 00:01:51.701
(whimsical music)

